.TH PSModelIsBuilt 3 2024-03-09 "PsyC 0.9.5" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
\fBPSModelIsBuilt\fR \- Check whether model is built

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/psyc.h>

.I
int  
.br
\fBPSModelIsBuilt\fR(\fIPSModel *model\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check whether \fImodel\fR is built (see: \fIPSModelBuild\fR).  

.SH RETURN VALUES
1 if the model is built, 0 if it's not built.

.SH SEE ALSO
psyc(1), PSModelBuild(3), PSModelRebuild(3)
